      "golden_response": "Reference approach (passes all 10 cases):\n\n```python\nclass Solution:\n    def search(self, nums: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n        lo, hi = 0, len(nums) - 1\n        while lo <= hi:\n            mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n            if nums[mid] == target:\n                return mid\n            if nums[mid] < target:\n                lo = mid + 1\n            else:\n                hi = mid - 1\n        return -1\n```",
